rob": -0.1794675778941948, "compression_ratio": 1.7413127413127414, "no_speech_prob": 0.010326896794140339}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17554, "start": 175.79999999999998, "end": 179.66, "text": " by the Gentiles, until the times of the Gentiles are fulfilled.", "tokens": [50378, 538, 264, 33070, 4680, 11, 1826, 264, 1413, 295, 264, 33070, 4680, 366, 21380, 13, 50571], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17554, "start": 181.01999999999998, "end": 184.42, "text": " And there will be signs in sun, and moon, and stars,", "tokens": [50639, 400, 456, 486, 312, 7880, 294, 3295, 11, 293, 7135, 11, 293, 6105, 11, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17554, "start": 184.84, "end": 188.04, "text": " and on the earth distress of nations in perplexity,", "tokens": [50830, 293, 322, 264, 4120, 24516, 295, 11035, 294, 680, 18945, 507, 11, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17554, "start": 188.39999999999998, "end": 191.29999999999998, "text": " because of the roaring of the sea and the waves,", "tokens": [51008, 570, 295, 264, 36231, 295, 264, 4158, 293, 264, 9417, 11, 51153], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17554, "start": 191.95999999999998, "end": 196.29999999999998, "text": " people fainting with fear and with foreboding of what is coming on the world.", "tokens": [51186, 561, 283, 491, 783, 365, 4240, 293, 365, 2091, 65, 8616, 295, 437, 307, 1348, 322, 264, 1002, 13, 51403], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17554, "start": 196.89999999999998, "end": 199.35999999999999, "text": " For the powers of the heavens will be shaken,", "tokens": [51433, 1171, 264, 8674, 295, 264, 26011, 486, 312, 40971, 11, 51556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17554, "start": 199.35999999999999, "end": 205.35999999999999, "text": " and then they will see the Son of Man coming in a cloud with power and great glory,", "tokens": [51556, 293, 550, 436, 486, 536, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 1348, 294, 257, 4588, 365, 1347, 293, 869, 11924, 11, 51856], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19113567186438518, "compression_ratio": 1.831896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016481137135997415}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20554, "start": 205.54, "end": 206.38, "text": " and then they will see the Son of Man coming in a cloud with power and great glory.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 550, 436, 486, 536, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 1348, 294, 257, 4588, 365, 1347, 293, 869, 11924, 13, 50407], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20554, "start": 206.38, "end": 208.73999999999998, "text": " Now when these things begin to take place,", "tokens": [50407, 823, 562, 613, 721, 1841, 281, 747, 1081, 11, 50525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20554, "start": 209.29999999999998, "end": 211.48, "text": " straighten up and raise your heads,", "tokens": [50553, 32777, 493, 293, 5300, 428, 8050, 11, 50662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20554, "start": 211.9, "end": 214.6, "text": " because your redemption is drawing near.", "tokens": [50683, 570, 428, 35644, 307, 6316, 2651, 13, 50818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20554, "start": 215.68, "end": 217.29999999999998, "text": " And he told them a parable.", "tokens": [50872, 400, 415, 1907, 552, 257, 971, 712, 13, 50953], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20554, "start": 217.79999999999998, "end": 220.68, "text": " Look at the fig tree and all the trees.", "tokens": [50978, 2053, 412, 264, 2147, 4230, 293, 439, 264, 5852, 13, 51122], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20554, "start": 221.32, "end": 222.76, "text": " As soon as they come out in leaf,", "tokens": [51154, 1018, 2321, 382, 436, 808, 484, 294, 10871, 11, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 66, "seek": 20554, "start": 223.28, "end": 226.56, "text": " you see for yourselves and know that the summer is already near.", "tokens": [51252, 291, 536, 337, 14791, 293, 458, 300, 264, 4266, 307, 1217, 2651, 13, 51416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 67, "seek": 20554, "start": 227.14, "end": 230.18, "text": " So also when you see these things taking place,", "tokens": [51445, 407, 611, 562, 291, 536, 613, 721, 1940, 1081, 11, 51597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20554, "start": 230.76, "end": 233.07999999999998, "text": " you know that the kingdom of God is near.", "tokens": [51626, 291, 458, 300, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 307, 2651, 13, 51742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20554, "start": 233.98, "end": 235.2, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [51787, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 51848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2995073740718929, "compression_ratio": 1.7204301075268817, "no_speech_prob": 0.002865297021344304}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23554, "start": 235.54, "end": 239.56, "text": " this generation will not pass away until all has taken place.", "tokens": [50365, 341, 5125, 486, 406, 1320, 1314, 1826, 439, 575, 2726, 1081, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15913513847019362, "compression_ratio": 1.7269076305220883, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004172994813416153}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23554, "start": 240.23999999999998, "end": 241.78, "text": " Heaven and earth will pass away,", "tokens": [50600, 13676, 293, 4120, 486, 1320, 1314, 11, 50677], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15913513847019362, "compression_ratio": 1.7269076305220883, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004172994813416153}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23554, "start": 242.26, "end": 244.38, "text": " but my words will not pass away.", "tokens": [50701, 457, 452, 2283, 486, 406, 1320, 1314, 13, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15913513847019362, "compression_ratio": 1.7269076305220883, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004172994813416153}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23554, "start": 245.64, "end": 246.94, "text": " But watch yourselves,", "tokens": [50870, 583, 1159, 14791, 11, 50935], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15913513847019362, "compression_ratio": 1.7269076305220883, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004172994813416153}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23554, "start": 247.44, "end": 250.66, "text": " lest your hearts be weighed down with dissipation and drunkenness", "tokens": [50960, 287, 377, 428, 8852, 312, 32844, 760, 365, 29544, 399, 293, 